---
description: Git commit rules for AnantaOne — no vendor attribution
alwaysApply: true
---

Never add "Made-with: Cursor", "Co-authored-by: Cursor", "Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com", or any other AI IDE / coding-agent attribution trailer to commits, PRs, or code comments.

Do not put Cursor (or any IDE vendor) names, logos, badges, or watermarks in source, UI, or product-facing docs. See `cloud-dev.md` for the full cloud-based / zero-trace rules.

Commits should use the project identity only (AnantaOne / company email), not personal Showrav88 branding in messages or trailers.
